/// - `gpu.prop_gpu_transfer_buffer_create_name_string`: a name that can be displayed in debugging tools.
///
/// - **Parameters:**
///   - `device`: a GPU Context.
///   - `createinfo`: a struct describing the state of the transfer buffer to create.
