/// If this function returns NULL, to signify an error, `*count` will be set to zero.
///
/// - **Returns:** a 0 terminated array of device instance IDs, or NULL on failure; call error_.get() for more information. The returned slice is allocated with the caller-provided allocator.
/// - **Thread safety:** It is safe to call this function from any thread.
