}

/// Get the ball axis change since the last poll.
///
/// Trackballs can only return relative motion since the last call to joystick.Joystick.getBall(), these motion deltas are placed into `dx` and `dy`.
/// Most joysticks do not have trackballs.
///
/// - **Parameters:**
///   - `joystick_2`: the joystick.Joystick to query.
///   - `ball`: the ball index to query; ball indices start at index 0.
