}

/// Get UTF-8 text from the primary selection.
///
/// This function returns an empty string if there is not enough memory left for a copy of the primary selection's content.
///
/// - **Returns:** the primary selection text on success or an empty string on failure; call error_.get() for more information. The returned slice is allocated with the caller-provided allocator.
/// - **Thread safety:** This function should only be called on the main thread.
