/// - `surface.prop_surface_rotation_float`: the number of degrees a surface's data is meant to be rotated clockwise to make the image right-side up. Default1. This is used by the camera API, if a mobile device is oriented differently than what its camera provides (i.e. - the camera always provides portrait images but the phone is being held in landscape orientation). Since SDL 3.4.0.
