/// - **Returns:** a pointer to a new surface.Surface structure or NULL on failure; call error_.get() for more information.
/// - **Thread safety:** It is safe to call this function from any thread.
/// - **Since:** This function is available since SDL 3.4.0.
/// - **See also:** surface.destroy
