/// Round `x` to the nearest integer representable as a long
///
/// Rounds `x` to the nearest integer. Values halfway between integers will be rounded away from zero.
/// Domain: `-INF <= x <= INF`
/// Range: `MIN_LONG <= y <= MAX_LONG`
