/// - **Thread safety:** This function should only be called on the main thread.
/// - **Since:** This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.
/// - **See also:** render.createRenderer
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderClear
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderFillRect
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderFillRects
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderLine
