/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderPoint
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderPoints
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderRect
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.renderRects
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.setRenderDrawBlendMode
/// - **See also:** render.Renderer.setRenderDrawColor
///
