/// This category covers measuring time elapsed (SDL_GetTicks(),
/// SDL_GetPerformanceCounter()), putting a thread to sleep for a certain
/// amount of time (SDL_Delay(), SDL_DelayNS(), SDL_DelayPrecise()), and firing
